  "_comment": "Who the lab's sign-in tool can sign in as, and how. NO SECRETS HERE: every secret is a reference - a macOS login Keychain item (service + account) or, for Splunk's own admin, the gitignored lab/splunk/.env key the stack is built around. identity.mjs validates this file (validateRegistry) and refuses plain strings where a reference belongs. GitHub is not here on purpose: it stays the owner's own sign-in.",
